        "A rule that references an unknown field name (`{ field: typo, operator: eq, value: 1 }`) fails app schema validation with an error naming the form and the typo",
        "An operator inappropriate for the referenced field type (e.g. `gte` on a single-line-text field) fails app schema validation with a clear type-mismatch error",
        "When a field is BOTH hidden by `visibleWhen` AND has a non-null `defaultValue`, the value is NOT submitted (visibleWhen wins; hidden-by-condition is treated as \"not part of this submission\")",
