        "A config with `forms[]` and no `pages[]` validates and serves form HTML at `/forms/{name}` (form-only app use case)",
        "`submitTo` requires at least one of `table`, `automation`, or `storeSubmission: true`; a `submitTo` with all three falsy fails validation with a message that lists the three options",
        "`submitTo.table` must reference an existing `tables[].name`; an unknown table name fails validation with an error pointing to the form and the missing table",
        "`submitTo.automation` must reference an existing `automations[].name`; an unknown automation name fails validation with an error pointing to the form and the missing automation",
