        "The `$t:` syntax is recognized in: `forms[].title`, `forms[].description`, `forms[].display.submitLabel`, each field's `label`, `placeholder`, `helpText`, the post-submit redirect targets `forms[].onSuccess.redirect.url` and `forms[].onSuccess.successPage.actions[].url` (server-resolved — verified by APP-FORMS-144), and single/multi-select `options[].label` values (server-resolved — verified by APP-FORMS-145). String properties outside this allow-list (e.g. `forms[].name`, `forms[].path`, an option's `value`) render the literal value with no resolution attempt",
